The test corpus under equation_rs/tests/ cross-checks generated equations against
the standard OBD-II PID formulas as tabulated in the Wikipedia article
"OBD-II PIDs" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OBD-II_PIDs), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
The formulas themselves are the SAE J1979 definitions; PID names in the corpus
follow that article's wording.

"Torque" refers to the Torque Android app's equation dialect, which this crate
implements independently for compatibility. Torque is a trademark of its owner.
